Admin panel dependencies

admin/ is Greengram's own code under this repository's licence. Its npm
packages are not copied into the repository: scripts/build-admin.sh installs
them at the versions pinned in admin/bun.lock and bundles them into
admin-assets/main.js and main.css. That build carries code from these
packages, all under licences that may be combined with the AGPL-3.0:

- @cloudflare/kumo 2.16.0 (MIT, Cloudflare, Inc.), which itself bundles
  Base UI and Floating UI (MIT)
- @phosphor-icons/react 2.1.10 (MIT, Phosphor Icons)
- react, react-dom 19.3.1, scheduler (MIT, Meta Platforms, Inc.)
- use-sync-external-store (MIT, Meta Platforms, Inc.)
- echarts 6.1.0 (Apache-2.0, The Apache Software Foundation), notice below
- zrender 6.1.0 (BSD-3-Clause, Baidu Inc.)
- tslib (0BSD, Microsoft Corporation)
- lottie-web 5.13.0 (MIT, Bodymovin)
- tailwindcss 4.3.3 (MIT, Tailwind Labs, Inc.): generates main.css

Build tools only, not in the output: bun, bun-plugin-tailwind (MIT). Each
package's licence text is in its directory under admin/node_modules after
`bun install`.

